      "alt": "Baseline study interface with a chronological AI conversation on the left and a source-code state on the right. Alternating blue student messages and gray AI answers discuss printing rows and checking whether a list is empty. The adjacent Python editor shows the student gradebook program with line numbers and syntax highlighting."
