      "sha256": "2d91be3281e7dc40f72d5fb3b56265d3b976f9efe0f85163574eea2c6516c7ff",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 7. Five questions compare Editrail with Baseline on a seven-point preference scale: 1 means prefer Editrail, 4 is neutral, and 7 means prefer Baseline. Twelve participants answered each question. Counts in order from 1 through 7: less extra workflow effort, 4, 4, 1, 1, 0, 0, 2; helpful guidance on AI usage, 4, 4, 2, 0, 0, 0, 2; identifying when and which students need intervention, 6, 3, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1; identifying unproductive AI usage patterns, 5, 2, 0, 1, 1, 0, 3; less effort understanding students’ AI usage, 5, 4, 0, 0, 1, 0, 2. Responses favor Editrail on every question."
    }
